# spells2: every other kind of spell effect, cast by the mage (AZALIS, member 3) at the monsters of cell 436 as in spell.keys:
# burning hands, fear (the view flash), fireball, lightning bolt, ice storm, cone of cold, then armor on the party (the portrait flash).
option save fixtures/EOBDATA.SAV
idle
mark load
key ENTER
idle
poke FBCA 468
poke FBCC 0
poke 7294 1
poke F890 0x1402
poke F892 0x120D
poke F894 0x1815
poke F6AE 0x6464
idle
shot start
mark cursor
key z
key z
key z
key s
mark panel
key u
mark burning
key SPACE
wait 40
idle
shot burning
mark panel
key u
mark fear
key SPACE
wait 40
idle
shot fear
mark panel
key u
mark fireball
key SPACE
wait 60
idle
shot fireball
mark panel
key u
mark bolt
key SPACE
wait 60
idle
shot bolt
mark panel
key u
mark icestorm
key SPACE
wait 60
idle
shot icestorm
mark panel
key u
mark cone
key SPACE
wait 60
idle
shot cone
poke F890 0x0001
mark panel
key u
mark armor
key SPACE
key F1
wait 40
idle
shot armor
quit
